        "custom": "Pokémon"
      },
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>O Pokémon Escudo. Graças à face blindada, Shieldon quase nunca precisa lutar. Ele se alimenta de grama e frutas. Nas selvas primitivas, tinha poucos inimigos capazes de atravessar sua proteção.</p><p><strong>SR:</strong> 3 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Nível Mínimo Encontrado:</strong> 1 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Grupo de Ovos:</strong> Monstro &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Gênero:</strong> 88% M / 12% F &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Estágio Evolutivo:</strong> 1/2</p><p><strong>Evolução:</strong> Shieldon pode evoluir para Bastiodon no nível 10 ou superior. Quando evolui, seus pontos de vida aumentam no dobro do seu nível.</p><h3>Moves por Nível</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Nível</th><th>Moves adquiridos</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='text-align:center'>1</td><td>Protect, Tackle</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>2</td><td>Taunt</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>4</td><td>Metal Sound</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>5</td><td>Take Down</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>7</td><td>Iron Defense</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>8</td><td>Swagger</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>10</td><td>Ancient Power</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>11</td><td>Endure</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>13</td><td>Metal Burst</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>14</td><td>Iron Head</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>15</td><td>Heavy Slam</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>TMs</h3><p>Attract, Blizzard, Body Slam, Bulldoze, Confide, Curse, Dig, Double Team, Double-Edge, Earth Power, Earthquake, Endure, Facade, Fire Blast, Flamethrower, Flash Cannon, Focus Energy, Frustration, Hard Press, Heavy Slam, Hidden Power, Ice Beam, Iron Defense, Iron Head, Iron Tail, Magnet Rise, Metal Sound, Mud-Slap, Power Gem, Protect, Rain Dance, Rest, Return, Roar, Rock Blast, Rock Polish, Rock Slide, Rock Smash, Rock Tomb, Round, Sand Tomb, Sandstorm, Scary Face, Scorching Sands, Shock Wave, Sleep Talk, Smack Down, Snore, Stealth Rock, Steel Beam, Stomping Tantrum, Stone Edge, Substitute, Sunny Day, Swagger, Take Down, Taunt, Tera Blast, Thunder, Thunderbolt, Torment, Toxic, Trailblaze</p><h3>Egg Moves</h3><p>Body Slam, Counter, Curse, Double-Edge, Fissure, Focus Energy, Guard Split, Headbutt, Rock Blast, Scary Face, Screech, Stealth Rock, Wide Guard</p>",
